# The raw OSM downloads. 40 MB of JSON that only exists to be compiled once --
# backend/data/roadgraph.bin is the compiled graph and IS committed, because
# production loads it with `seed_roadgraph --from-blob` and must never depend on
# Overpass being up on the day.
backend/data/*.osm.json

